<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Budget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A structured statement of how funds are to be used for expenditure in defined budget categories. A budget is created, for example, when applying for funding for a project, and is subsequently used to manage the expenditure from the awarded grant for that project."@en .
